              "id": "de7b5aee-dc04-483d-8e1c-cefc12b0fdc7",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>The Book of Esports: The Definitive Guide to Competitive Video Games</strong></em> was written by William Collis, published by RosettaBooks, August 4, 2020."
